// English localization (PLAN §1.2: v1 is English-only; LocKey is
// indirection into this file).
//
// `strings` maps LocKey text -> English display string. Key convention:
//   system.<id>.<field>   — e.g. system.home.epoch_note
//   body.<id>.name        — a body's display name
//   biome.<body>.<biome>  — a biome's display name (matches the legend
//                           entry's `name` LocKey in biomes.ron)
//   part.<part id>.name   — a part's display name
//   part.variant.<vid>    — a part variant's display name (variants are
//                           shared vocabulary across parts, so the keys
//                           are not per-part)
//   resource.<rid>        — a resource's display name
//   exp.<id>.name         — an experiment's display name
